[heading]Version 0.4.16[/heading]

[list]
[*]Stabilized trader visit data to reduce duplicate destinations caused by older position-based trader keys.
[*]Existing duplicate trader entries are merged into canonical trader-area keys when possible.
[*]A one-time backup is created before automatic JSON normalization.
[*]Improved current-trader filtering when old and new keys refer to the same nearby trader.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
